// The Core surface the ledger scores beyond Core.rows's module exports and
// the compiler's Core call records (which the ledger reads from
// `jet inspect structure --core`). Read by Tools/Agent/CoreSurfaceLedger.jet;
// this file is its only home for these rows.
//
// `receivers <Container> { source, ... }` names the Jet tables a ledger
// container's receiver and static methods come from; the ledger reads the
// method names from those tables, so this file never copies them:
//   builtin:<BuiltinMethodReceiver>   BUILTIN_METHOD_ROWS (Registry/BuiltinMethods.jet)
//   collection:<CollectionReceivers>  COLLECTION_OPERATIONS (Collections.jet); a
//                                     Sequence row serves List and Iter
//   static:[<module>.]<owner>         BUILTIN_STATIC_ROWS (Registry/BuiltinStatics.jet)
//   numeric:conversions               BUILTIN_NUMERIC_SOURCES (Registry/BuiltinStatics.jet)
//   source:Duration                   core.time's `__duration_<method>` functions (Core/Time/Time.jet)
//   type:<core module>.<Type>         the type's methods in its Core source
// `methods <Container> { method, ... }` names only the methods sema checks in
// code with no table to read (the handle families). Each name must be spelled
// in Compiler/JetSema/Source and must not already come from the container's
// receivers row.

methods AsyncEvent { blocked_count, close, emit_async, listener_count, on, on_priority, once, queued_count, running_count }
receivers Bits { collection:Bits, static:Bits }
receivers Bytes { builtin:Bytes, static:Bytes }
receivers Cache { collection:Cache, static:Cache }
receivers Cell { static:Cell }
methods Cell { edit, get, get_or_set, guard_edit, guard_read, read, replace, set }
methods CellGuard { edit, get, map, read, second, set, split }
receivers Clock { type:core.time.Clock }
receivers Condition { type:core.tasks.Condition, static:Condition }
methods core.compiler { action, add_asset_bundle, add_doc, add_executable, add_install, add_library, add_package, add_publish, add_test, build_profiles, cause, code, collisions, content_hash, contribute, debug_info, dependencies, description, diagnostics, edition, effects, entry, error, extends, fetch, file, find, fingerprint, functions, generate, generated_lines, inferred_layer, items, jet, key, kind, layer, license, message, name, optimize, outputs, packages, panic, plan, profiles, repository, revision, root_dependencies, schema_version, semantic_index, small, source, source_kind, sources, syntax, target, targets, tokens, toolchain, value, version }
receivers core.crypto.vault { type:core.crypto.vault.WrappedVaultKey, static:core.crypto.vault.KeyUnlock }
receivers core.math { builtin:Integer, builtin:Float, builtin:ExactInt, builtin:FixedInt, builtin:Scalar, builtin:Ordering, static:Int, static:Float, static:F64, static:Decimal, static:Fraction, static:Char, static:U32, numeric:conversions, type:core.math.Decimal, type:core.math.Fraction }
receivers core.net.tls { type:core.net.tls.TLSStream }
receivers core.process { static:Authority }
methods core.process { with, without }
methods core.reflect { call_edges, definitions, foreign, functions, has, has_method, is_active, marker, packages, reaches_panic, references, structural_nodes, types, unsubscribe }
receivers core.regex { type:core.regex.Regex, type:core.regex.Match }
receivers core.service { type:core.service.ServiceTree, type:core.service.ServiceWorkflow, type:core.service.ServiceEndpoint, type:core.service.Delivery, type:core.service.DeliveryState, type:core.service.ServiceRuntime }
receivers core.sync { builtin:Atomic, builtin:AtomicAdd, builtin:AtomicInt, static:Atomic }
receivers core.sys { type:core.sys.Fd, type:core.sys.SharedMemory }
receivers core.testing { type:core.testing.Test }
receivers core.time { static:Duration }
methods core.time.expiring { new }
methods DecisionHook { listener_count, on, on_priority, once, run }
receivers Derived { type:core.web.store.Derived }
receivers DeterministicWorld { type:core.testing.DeterministicWorld }
methods DispatchReport { accepted, delivered_handlers, state, trace }
receivers Duration { source:Duration }
methods Event { emit, listener_count, on, on_priority, once, trace }
methods EventScope { active_count, cancel }
methods EventTrace { delivered, dropped, queued, summary }
methods Hook { listener_count, on, on_priority, once, run, trace }
receivers Iter { collection:Iter }
methods Iter { zip, zip_pad, zip_short }
receivers List { collection:List, static:List }
methods List { para_filter, para_fold, para_map, para_partition, view, zip, zip_pad, zip_short }
receivers Map { collection:Map, static:Map }
methods Option { map, or_err, why }
receivers Pool { static:Pool }
methods Pool { add, ids, remove }
receivers PriorityQueue { collection:PriorityQueue, static:PriorityQueue }
receivers Queue { collection:Queue, static:Queue }
receivers Rank { collection:Rank, static:Rank }
methods Receiver { close, delay_ms, is_canceled, is_interval, is_ready, is_timer, receive, try_receive }
receivers Rng { type:core.math.random.RNG }
methods Sender { close, send }
receivers Set { collection:Set, static:Set }
receivers Shared { static:Shared }
methods Shared { capture, downgrade, edit, guard_edit, guard_edit_within, guard_read, guard_read_within, read, same, strong_count, try_guard_edit, try_guard_read, try_replace }
methods SharedGuard { map, second, split, wait }
methods SharedSnapshot { value }
methods SharedWeak { upgrade }
methods Signal { get, set }
receivers String { builtin:String, static:String }
methods Subscription { is_active, unsubscribe }
receivers Tally { collection:Tally, static:Tally }
methods Task { cancel, detach, join, pause, resume, trace }
receivers View { collection:View }
receivers WatchHandle { type:core.watcher.WatchHandle }
receivers WatchSet { type:core.watcher.WatchSet }
